1
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:08,760
Sgt. Kellar: We were almost there.

2
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:15,600
Sgt. Kellar: I wanted to kill him so bad I could taste it — like blood in my mouth.

3
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,380
Sgt. Kellar: I was closer than any of the others.

4
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:21,780
Sgt. Kellar: There was no way I was gonna let him get away.
